    </header>
    <body>
        <segment id="1" parent="20" relname="span">I think the site has several design issues.</segment>
        <segment id="2" parent="24" relname="span">first off, the brown text on the yellow background color scheme is not very easy on the eyes.</segment>
        <segment id="3" parent="2" relname="volitional-result">This could be hard for seniors to read.</segment>
        <segment id="4" parent="23" relname="list">Secondly, their are too many menu options to select from,</segment>
        <segment id="5" parent="26" relname="span">and last but not least I think the site may be too difficult for seniors to navigate.</segment>
        <segment id="6" parent="5" relname="evidence">There are too many pop-up menus</segment>
        <segment id="7" parent="26" relname="evidence">and to view a lot of the information on the site you have to use scrollbars.</segment>
        <segment id="8" parent="22" relname="span">I have spent some time volunteering at Broward Grandparents in Ft. Lauderdale</segment>
        <segment id="9" parent="8" relname="elaboration">where we teach seniors basic computer skills like how to browse the web, type, and navigate the mouse.</segment>
        <segment id="10" parent="21" relname="span">We have found that one of the most difficult tasks for them to perform is navigating the mouse.</segment>
        <segment id="11" parent="10" relname="elaboration">Even clicking the right button on the mouse is sometimes troublesome for them.</segment>
        <segment id="12" parent="18" relname="span">I think the site should be redesigned to eliminate the pop-up menus and at least some of the scrollbars.</segment>
        <segment id="13" parent="19" relname="conjunction">However, the design is fairly simple</segment>
        <segment id="14" parent="19" relname="conjunction">and the font size is easy on the eyes.</segment>
        <segment id="15" parent="18" relname="elaboration">I also think that there is some what of a lack of implementation of the 508 standard.</segment>
        <group id="16" type="span"/>
        <group id="17" type="span" parent="16" relname="span"/>
        <group id="18" type="span" parent="28" relname="span"/>
        <group id="19" type="multinuc" parent="12" relname="concession"/>
        <group id="20" type="span" parent="17" relname="span"/>
        <group id="21" type="span" parent="27" relname="span"/>
